    {
      "subId": "7210704",
      "subQuestName": "Carry out the investigation at the abandoned shrine",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721070401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721070401": {
            "id": "721070401",
            "speakerId": 12007,
            "speakerName": "Inagi Hotomi",
            "text": "The use of sacred words was said to have become a lost art after the Kamuna bloodline failed...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070402"
            ]
          },
          "721070402": {
            "id": "721070402",
            "speakerId": 12007,
            "speakerName": "Inagi Hotomi",
            "text": "...Ah, sorry, I didn't see you there. The Memento Lens is yours to keep. Take it out to see the world, would you?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7210703",
      "subQuestName": "Continue the investigation at the abandoned shrine",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721070301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721070301": {
            "id": "721070301",
            "speakerId": 12007,
            "speakerName": "Inagi Hotomi",
            "text": "Hello, Traveler from afar. Welcome to the Grand Narukami Shrine!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070302"
            ]
          },
          "721070302": {
            "id": "721070302",
            "speakerId": 12007,
            "speakerName": "Inagi Hotomi",
            "text": "If you have some trouble or just want to make a wish, feel free to ask Ms. Gendou for a fortune slip. May the Electro Archon bless you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070303"
            ]
          },
          "721070303": {
            "id": "721070303",
            "speakerId": 12007,
            "speakerName": "Inagi Hotomi",
            "text": "I see. I understand the situation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070304"
            ]
          },
          "721070304": {
            "id": "721070304",
            "speakerId": 12007,
            "speakerName": "Inagi Hotomi",
            "text": "The Sacred Sakura Cleansing Ritual is a very important rite, and there are indeed records of it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070305"
            ]
          },
          "721070305": {
            "id": "721070305",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070306"
            ]
          },
          "721070306": {
            "id": "721070306",
            "speakerId": 12007,
            "speakerName": "Inagi Hotomi",
            "text": "But the actual details of the ritual have been lost. The Summary you are holding is a very valuable historical artifact in that regard.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070307"
            ]
          },
          "721070307": {
            "id": "721070307",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Lost?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070308"
            ]
          },
          "721070308": {
            "id": "721070308",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Are the Fatui behind this? If you say it's so important, then they might be up to something here too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070309"
            ]
          },
          "721070309": {
            "id": "721070309",
            "speakerId": 12007,
            "speakerName": "Inagi Hotomi",
            "text": "Oh no. The degradation here is due to poor preservation, humidity, and moths.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070310"
            ]
          },
          "721070310": {
            "id": "721070310",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070311"
            ]
          },
          "721070311": {
            "id": "721070311",
            "speakerId": 12007,
            "speakerName": "Inagi Hotomi",
            "text": "Ah, it's a great shame, but a lot of historical records have been lost. Lady Yae and Sir Kamisato were fretting over this earlier as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070312"
            ]
          },
          "721070312": {
            "id": "721070312",
            "speakerId": 12007,
            "speakerName": "Inagi Hotomi",
            "text": "But as for the sacred words, I do know a thing or two.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070313"
            ]
          },
          "721070313": {
            "id": "721070313",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Mm-hmm! Please tell us how to unseal that ward!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070314"
            ]
          },
          "721070314": {
            "id": "721070314",
            "speakerId": 12007,
            "speakerName": "Inagi Hotomi",
            "text": "I apologize, but the sacred words used to seal the ward are not some sort of specific formula.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070315"
            ]
          },
          "721070315": {
            "id": "721070315",
            "speakerId": 12007,
            "speakerName": "Inagi Hotomi",
            "text": "... Instead, they are something created by the one who casts the seal themselves.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070316"
            ]
          },
          "721070316": {
            "id": "721070316",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh? What do you mean...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070317"
            ]
          },
          "721070317": {
            "id": "721070317",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The spell... was created on the fly by the caster?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070318"
            ]
          },
          "721070318": {
            "id": "721070318",
            "speakerId": 12007,
            "speakerName": "Inagi Hotomi",
            "text": "This is not precisely so, either. Sacred words of this sort do have some rules.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070319"
            ]
          },
          "721070319": {
            "id": "721070319",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Do elaborate.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070320"
            ]
          },
          "721070320": {
            "id": "721070320",
            "speakerId": 12007,
            "speakerName": "Inagi Hotomi",
            "text": "Hmm... I believe that the records go something like this.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070321"
            ]
          },
          "721070321": {
            "id": "721070321",
            "speakerId": 12007,
            "speakerName": "Inagi Hotomi",
            "text": "The first line represents one's own status in Inazuma. Something with the word \"envoy\" attached to it, I believe...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070322"
            ]
          },
          "721070322": {
            "id": "721070322",
            "speakerId": 12007,
            "speakerName": "Inagi Hotomi",
            "text": "The second line is meant to explain the source of one's power. Something like dango, ramen, or a light novel, for example.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070323"
            ]
          },
          "721070323": {
            "id": "721070323",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooh, Paimon gets it. Those are definitely great power sources!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070324"
            ]
          },
          "721070324": {
            "id": "721070324",
            "speakerId": 12007,
            "speakerName": "Inagi Hotomi",
            "text": "I'm just giving an example. The records use something like \"Onmyou Hakkyou.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070325"
            ]
          },
          "721070325": {
            "id": "721070325",
            "speakerId": 12007,
            "speakerName": "Inagi Hotomi",
            "text": "As for the third line...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070328"
            ]
          },
          "721070328": {
            "id": "721070328",
            "speakerId": 12007,
            "speakerName": "Inagi Hotomi",
            "text": "Yes, you've guessed it. It can be whatever you want it to be.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070329"
            ]
          },
          "721070329": {
            "id": "721070329",
            "speakerId": 12007,
            "speakerName": "Inagi Hotomi",
            "text": "Considering how long it's been, I doubt that any still live who understand how to use this third line.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070330"
            ]
          },
          "721070330": {
            "id": "721070330",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ugh, what shall we do, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070331"
            ]
          },
          "721070331": {
            "id": "721070331",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Miss Masked Maiden's commission... and this whole nation... it's all gonna go kaput!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7210705",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721070501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721070501": {
            "id": "721070501",
            "speakerId": 20285,
            "speakerName": "Mysterious Man",
            "text": "Hmm. Yes, it looks like the spirit veins here can still be used.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070502"
            ]
          },
          "721070502": {
            "id": "721070502",
            "speakerId": 20285,
            "speakerName": "Mysterious Man",
            "text": "Her familiars are also here. Yes, it is a fine place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070503"
            ]
          },
          "721070503": {
            "id": "721070503",
            "speakerId": 20285,
            "speakerName": "Mysterious Man",
            "text": "Well then, allow me to use sacred words to protect this ward.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070504"
            ]
          },
          "721070504": {
            "id": "721070504",
            "speakerId": 20285,
            "speakerName": "Mysterious Man",
            "text": "Then the first line shall be <color=#00E1FFFF>\"In the name of Narukami's envoy.\"</color>"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7210706",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721070601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721070601": {
            "id": "721070601",
            "speakerId": 20285,
            "speakerName": "Mysterious Man",
            "text": "...Guess I'll just follow the previous example and use <color=#00E1FFFF>\"And of the Hakushin bloodline.\"</color> as the second line. I am no master onmyouji, after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070602"
            ]
          },
          "721070602": {
            "id": "721070602",
            "speakerId": 20286,
            "speakerName": "Mysterious Woman",
            "text": "You are... that person who seems very nice on the surface.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070603"
            ]
          },
          "721070603": {
            "id": "721070603",
            "speakerId": 20285,
            "speakerName": "Mysterious Man",
            "text": "Hey, long time no see. Guess you're still so cold to me, huh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070604"
            ]
          },
          "721070604": {
            "id": "721070604",
            "speakerId": 20285,
            "speakerName": "Mysterious Man",
            "text": "...Wait, no. Who are you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070605"
            ]
          },
          "721070605": {
            "id": "721070605",
            "speakerId": 20285,
            "speakerName": "Mysterious Man",
            "text": "This scent... Is it time for the Cleansing Ritual again?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070606"
            ]
          },
          "721070606": {
            "id": "721070606",
            "speakerId": 20286,
            "speakerName": "Mysterious Woman",
            "text": "I am... Call me \"Hanachirusato.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070607"
            ]
          },
          "721070607": {
            "id": "721070607",
            "speakerId": 20285,
            "speakerName": "Mysterious Man",
            "text": "...No need to tell me. I get it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070608"
            ]
          },
          "721070608": {
            "id": "721070608",
            "speakerId": 20285,
            "speakerName": "Mysterious Man",
            "text": "I thought she had returned for a moment there... Huh, so that's what happened.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070609"
            ]
          },
          "721070609": {
            "id": "721070609",
            "speakerId": 20285,
            "speakerName": "Mysterious Man",
            "text": "Yeah, don't worry about it. Nice to meet you, Miss Hanachirusato!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070610"
            ]
          },
          "721070610": {
            "id": "721070610",
            "speakerId": 20286,
            "speakerName": "Mysterious Woman",
            "text": "I... I remember now. About the Sacred Sakura. About you. About Raiden.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070611"
            ]
          },
          "721070611": {
            "id": "721070611",
            "speakerId": 20285,
            "speakerName": "Mysterious Man",
            "text": "Mm-hmm. Ah, wait. Perhaps what you're seeing right now is not me, but Ioroi in disguise.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070612"
            ]
          },
          "721070612": {
            "id": "721070612",
            "speakerId": 20285,
            "speakerName": "Mysterious Man",
            "text": "After all, Miss Hanachirusato, you've never seen me in person before, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070613"
            ]
          },
          "721070613": {
            "id": "721070613",
            "speakerId": 20286,
            "speakerName": "Mysterious Woman",
            "text": "I'm not sure there would be much difference either way, if my memory serves.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721070614"
            ]
          },
          "721070614": {
            "id": "721070614",
            "speakerId": 20285,
            "speakerName": "Mysterious Man",
            "text": "Eh? Come on, that was uncalled for..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
